, abandoning its own promises to ensure that the deal contained ironclad protections.", "type": "Loaded_Language", "reason": "Accusing the administration of 'lying' and using 'ironclad protections' are emotionally charged terms designed to provoke outrage."}, {"text": "This turned out to be a lie.", "type": "Loaded_Language", "reason": "Bluntly calling the statement a 'lie' uses strong language to discredit Kerry and the Obama administration."}, {"text": "After the JCPOA was finalized, with no such prohibition included, Iran continued to test such missiles.", "type": "Causal_Oversimplification", "reason": "Implies the lack of prohibition is solely responsible for Iran's missile testing, ignoring the broader geopolitical context."}, {"text": "the weak declaration in an annex that simply "calls upon" Iran not to undertake any activity", "type": "Loaded_Language", "reason": "The word 'weak' is an emotionally loaded descriptor used to disparage the UN resolution."}, {"text": "Iran has tested several ballistic missiles during the last two years, including two Qadr H missiles with the phrase "Israel must be wiped out" emblazoned on the sides.", "type": "Appeal_to_Fear-Prejudice", "reason": "Highlighting the threatening phrase on the missiles is designed to instill fear and prejudice against Iran."}, {"text": "Rhodes shamelessly denied that anytime, anywhere inspections were ever considered as part of the negotiations.", "type": "Loaded_Language", "reason": "The word 'shamelessly' is a strong emotional descriptor used to attack Rhodes's character and credibility."}, {"text": "This was another lie.", "type": "Loaded_Language", "reason": "Calling the statement 'another lie' uses blunt, accusatory language to repeatedly discredit the Obama administration."}, {"text": "as any clear-eyed observer of the process recognizes", "type": "Bandwagon,Reductio_ad_hitlerum", "reason": "Implies that any reasonable person agrees with the author's position, pressuring readers to conform to 